  "description": "Gwangnam, the leader of Killberos, dies and finds himself in the underworld with a black bracelet on his wrist. He soon learns that while one black bracelet means a ticket to hell, one hundred black bracelets can be traded in for a white bracelet, which is a ticket to reincarnation. \n\n(Source: WEBTOONS) \n\n*Note: Includes one prologue chapter.*",
